<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1002S_S000E" variety="S000E">
<name>Vehicle Surroundings Monitor</name>
<ttl id="1002S_S000E_746W2_T00DG" variety="T00DG">
<name>Back Guide Monitor System</name>
<para id="RM0000002O201CX" category="D" type-id="3001B" name-id="672ED-00" from="200612" to="200912">
<name>How to Proceed with Troubleshooting</name>
<subpara id="RM0000002O201CX_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___0000BCD00000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<descript-diag>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Vehicle brought to workshop</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000045U011X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Basic Inspection</testtitle>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Basic Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the battery voltage.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>11 to 14 V (Engine Stopped)</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Inspect areas that can be checked visually, such as blown fuses, open or short circuits in the wire harness and poor connector connections.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>CAN Communication System Check</testtitle>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), select "Diagnosis" → "CAN Bus Diagnosis" → "CAN Bus Connected ECU Check" to display the connected ECU check screen, and check all ECUs and sensors connected to CAN communication. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000001R4W009X"/>)</ptxt>
<table>
<title>Result</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.13in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>No Abnormality</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Abnormal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to CAN Communication System (see <xref label="Seep03" href="RM0000005RL01NX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Service Inspection (AVC-LAN Connection Check and AVC-LAN DTC Check)</testtitle>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For details of the procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep04" href="RM0000006XI02BX"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Service Inspection (AVC-LAN Connection Check)</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>On the service inspection screen, check that all connected devices are displayed.</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Part Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Device Name</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Navigation Receiver Assembly</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>AVN</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Toll Collection (ETC) Computer Assembly (w/ ETC System)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ETC</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Service Inspection (Individual Diagnosis Check)</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Record the DTCs.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Perform inspection and repair according to the instructions in the Diagnostic Trouble Code Chart.</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.13in"/>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Device Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Reference</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>AVN</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>
<xref label="Seep05" href="RM0000002RS03EX"/>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ETC (w/ ETC System)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>
<xref label="Seep06" href="RM000001US9001X"/>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear DTC</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Recheck DTC</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Based on the recorded DTCs, reproduce the problem symptom and check whether the DTCs are output again.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<table>
<title>Result</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No code, symptom can be confirmed and reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No code, symptom cannot be confirmed and reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Code output [When Replacing Navigation Receiver Assembly]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Code output [When Replacing Devices Other Than Above]</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>All connected devices other than AVN are displayed as "Not Connected"</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>All connected devices other than AVN are not displayed</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>D</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to Symptom Simulation (see <xref label="Seep07" href="RM000000ABY03DX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result>C</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 11</action-ci-right>
<result>D</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to Troubleshooting Flowchart AVC-LAN Malfunction (see <xref label="Seep08" href="RM0000007EM02GX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>HDD Navigation System Check</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check whether the same symptom occurs with the HDD navigation system.</ptxt>
<table>
<title>Result</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Same symptom does not occur</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Same symptom occurs</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to HDD Navigation System - Problem Symptoms Table (see <xref label="Seep09" href="RM0000008WW01OX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>List by Symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Problem Symptoms Table (see <xref label="Seep10" href="RM0000002O7018X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<table>
<title>Result</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Not listed in List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Corresponds to List by Symptom [When Replacing Navigation Receiver Assembly]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Corresponds to List by Symptom [When Replacing Devices Other Than Above]</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 11</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Perform troubleshooting using the following methods based on the problem symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Diagnosis System (see <xref label="Seep11" href="RM0000002O8019X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Terminals of ECU (see <xref label="Seep12" href="RM0000002O601AX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Adjust, Repair or Replace</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Confirmation Test</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
<action-ci-fin>END</action-ci-fin>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Replace Applicable Unit</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Work after Replacement</testtitle>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When replacing the navigation receiver assembly on a vehicle not subscribed to the G-BOOK service, perform the vehicle linking setting. (see <xref label="Seep13" href="RM000001C3S00RX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When replacing the navigation receiver assembly on a vehicle subscribed to the G-BOOK service, perform the vehicle linking setting, then perform the G-BOOK use resumption operation and HELPNET service start operation. (see <xref label="Seep14" href="RM000001C3S00RX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the navigation receiver assembly is replaced while a purchased G-SOUND unlimited license exists, perform G-SOUND license recovery. (see <xref label="Seep15" href="RM000001C3S00RX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Confirmation Test</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
<action-ci-fin>END</action-ci-fin>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
</descript-diag>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>